    "distinct_documents": 8,
    "gt_parts": 898,
    "distinct_parts": 496,
    "nine_vs_eight": "Both numbers are correct and neither is a defect to fix. The harness scores 9 FILENAMES; two of them -- Diodes_PCN_2683_FULLGREEN.pdf and Diodes_PCN_2683_Rev1_EOL.pdf -- are ONE document content (md5 abe083fe...) ingested under two names, so that document is scored twice at 402 parts. Hence 898 harness parts over 496 distinct ones: 402 of the 898 is the same notice counted a second time. Keep the 9 rows -- the duplicate pair is how the two-ingest case is exercised -- and never quote 898 as a count of distinct parts.",
